{"id":"1dd191d87afd7833","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombEvalRow.md","title":"CombEvalRow","display":"CombEvalRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CombEvalRow","parameters":["D","ap","k","s","e","z2248","z2249","z2250"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CombEvalRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>D</span><span>ap</span><span>k</span><span>s</span><span>e</span><span>z2248</span><span>z2249</span><span>z2250</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 固定组合代数与 PER 语义。有序参数：<code>D</code>、<code>ap</code>、<code>k</code>、<code>s</code>、<code>e</code>、<code>z2248</code>、<code>z2249</code>、<code>z2250</code>。</p>\n<p>固定集合大小代数中的有限组合项求值。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CombEvalRow D ap k s e z2248 z2249 z2250)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (exists v\n    (and\n      (@ Pair t v z2250)\n      (and\n        (@ CombRaw t)\n        (and\n          (in v D)\n          (and\n            (exists z2253 (@ SeqTo e z2253 D))\n            (or\n              (and (@ CombK t) (= v k))\n              (or\n                (and (@ CombS t) (= v s))\n                (or\n                  (exists z2254 (and (@ TVar z2254 t) (@ App e z2254 v)))\n                  (exists z2255\n                    (exists z2256\n                      (exists z2257\n                        (exists z2258\n                          (and\n                            (@ TApp z2255 z2256 t)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z2259\n                            (exists z2260 (and (in z2259 z2249) (and (@ App z2248 z2259 z2260) (@ Pair z2255 z2257 z2260)))))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z2261\n                            (exists z2262 (and (in z2261 z2249) (and (@ App z2248 z2261 z2262) (@ Pair z2256 z2258 z2262)))))\n                            (@ AlgebraApp ap z2257 z2258 v)))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83d12bd81841a9d9\" href=\"?note=83d12bd81841a9d9\" title=\"ZFC_AlgebraApp\">AlgebraApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59a386a959a99335\" href=\"?note=59a386a959a99335\" title=\"ZFC_CombK\">CombK</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0013cbf190631960\" href=\"?note=0013cbf190631960\" title=\"ZFC_CombRaw\">CombRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6940244b87569fc3\" href=\"?note=6940244b87569fc3\" title=\"ZFC_CombS\">CombS</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"572634b8affcd095\" href=\"?note=572634b8affcd095\" title=\"ZFC_SeqTo\">SeqTo</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","t